1a:["$","div",null,{"className":"relative w-full aspect-[21/9] rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden border-2 border-white/5 shadow-2xl","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"src":"/images/insitu_machining.png","alt":"DEI VOX Industrial","fill":true,"className":"object-cover opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-1000","priority":true}],["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black via-transparent to-transparent"}]]}]
1b:["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-32","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-20","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-8 seo-prose","children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-black uppercase mb-6 leading-tight","children":"BWCP: Boiler Water Circulation Experts"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"w-20 h-2 bg-accent mb-12"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["DEI VOX provides specialist repair, overhauling, and maintenance services for"," ","across India's power generation and industrial sectors. Our engineering team combines deep field experience with ISO-certified workshop processes to restore pump performance to OEM specification."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3","children":"Understanding the Boiler Water Circulation Pump"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"A  (commonly abbreviated as BCP) is a critical component in forced-circulation boiler systems. Unlike natural-circulation boilers, forced-circulation designs rely entirely on these pumps to maintain the required water flow rate through evaporator tube circuits — making pump reliability a direct determinant of boiler availability."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"BWCPs must handle one of the most demanding fluid services in industrial engineering: near-saturation water at pressures of 100 to 220 bar, temperatures approaching 350°C, and flow velocities designed to prevent nucleate boiling within individual evaporator tubes. The mechanical design, material selection, and manufacturing tolerances of these pumps must all satisfy codes such as EN 733, ISO 5199, and applicable ASME requirements."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary uppercase tracking-tight mt-10 mb-3","children":"How the Boiler Water Circulation Pump Works"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"The BWCP draws boiler drum water from the downcomer piping and delivers it to the inlet headers of the evaporator tube bundles. The pump head must overcome the friction and fittings losses in the circuit and maintain the required minimum flow margin above the onset of departure from nucleate boiling (DNB) in any individual tube."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"In canned motor pump designs — the most common configuration for high-pressure BWCPs — there is no mechanical shaft seal between the motor space and process fluid. The motor rotor rotates in the process water, which also lubricates the sleeve bearings. This eliminates seal leakage risk at high pressure but requires specialised expertise to repair, as bearing clearances, can liner integrity, and motor insulation all become interdependent parameters."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-foreground/80 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"The pump performance curve — head vs. flow — must be matched precisely to the boiler system resistance curve at design, part-load, and transient conditions. DEI VOX engineers verify hydraulic performance after every overhaul using calibrated test instrumentation."}],"$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37"]}],"$L38"]}]}]
